@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+# ELXVRO Blocks 0.34.0 — Crystal Storm Premium
+
+The original 100-stage animal adventure map remains unchanged.
+
+## Gameplay
+- Three breakable obstacle types are introduced by level: ice (stage 8), chains (stage 22), stone (stage 39). Stone requires two impacts; each cell receives no more than one hit per cascade step.
+- Locked cells cannot be swapped. Adjacent matches and boosters can remove obstacles, and finishing a stage requires both all animal collection goals and all obstacles.
+- The existing 8x9 board, escalating 1/2/3 animal goals, variable moves, and 100 illustrated animal stages remain intact.
+- Every fifth newly-completed level grants a milestone coin bonus; level reward transactions are once-only.
+
+## Visual/audio
+- Higher-impact electric arcs, seven concentric shockwaves, expanded radial shards, and chromatic pulse rings. Explosions scale with match counts and cascades, with a bounded per-frame particle budget.
+- Haptics and material impact audio remain linked to match intensity.
+- Obstacles are raster-free vector overlays so rendering is independent of network/assets.
+
+## Wallet and rewards
+- Crystal Vault reachable from adventure and gameplay. Three booster types cost 100/180/130 coins and persist across levels; inventory is capped at nine each.
+- A daily 60-coin chest and a 120-coin quest after three **new** levels, with once-per-day claims.
+- Android native wallet, daily claims, booster stock, and win rewards are committed with a single SharedPreferences editor transaction per action.
+- Non-Android platforms have a SharedPreferences fallback.
+
+## Validation
+- Unit tests cover obstacle generation/fracture, level balancing and deadlock avoidance, once-only rewards, stock debit/consume/persistence, and VFX work limits.
+- Flutter analyze and test suite run in GitHub Actions before signed release APK and AAB builds.
